Lua 5.4.7 — vendored from https://www.lua.org/ftp/lua-5.4.7.tar.gz

This directory contains the contents of that tarball's src/ directory, with
these Apprentice-local modifications:

  * lua.c and luac.c removed (they define main() and are not part of the
    embeddable library).
  * Every .c file renamed to .cpp, so it is compiled as C++. See
    apprentice_lua_config.h for why this is required.
  * apprentice_lua_config.h added, and included from the top of luaconf.h.

Nothing else in the Lua sources has been edited.

